        <section class="section container" id="research" aria-labelledby="research-title">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <p class="section-index">01 <span>/</span> Research</p>
                <h2 id="research-title">Performance is a<br><em>systems problem.</em></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="research-content">
                <div class="research-copy">
                    <p class="lead">My PhD research at Washington State University brings together deep learning compilers, hardware-software co-design, and 2.5D and 3D chiplet-based systems.</p>
                    <p>I build compiler optimizations for resource-constrained environments such as Edge AI and specialized sparse accelerators. Using infrastructures like <strong>MLIR</strong> and <strong>LLVM</strong>, I work across the stack—from intermediate representations and optimization passes to target-specific code generation.</p>
                    <p>I’m interested in closing the gap between high-level abstractions and the hardware that executes them, from GPU programming to accelerator and chiplet-based systems.</p>
                    <div class="tag-list" aria-label="Research topics">
                        <span>Deep learning compilers</span><span>Hardware-software co-design</span><span>2.5D / 3D chiplets</span><span>Sparse accelerators</span><span>GPU programming</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <aside class="pipeline-card" aria-label="Compiler lowering example">
                    <div class="pipeline-topline"><span>CO-DESIGN NOTE</span><span>IR → TARGET</span></div>
                    <div class="pipeline-step"><span class="step-number">01</span><code>tensor.matmul</code><span class="step-kind">model op</span></div>
                    <div class="pipeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓ <span>lower</span></div>
                    <div class="pipeline-step"><span class="step-number">02</span><code>vector.contract</code><span class="step-kind">compiler IR</span></div>
                    <div class="pipeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓ <span>map</span></div>
                    <div class="pipeline-step pipeline-target"><span class="step-number">03</span><code>RISC-V / GPU</code><span class="step-kind">hardware</span></div>
                    <details class="trace-details">
                        <summary>Inspect a lowering trace <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
                        <div class="trace-body"><code>high-level op</code><span>→</span><code>loop + vector IR</code><span>→</span><code>target instructions</code></div>
                        <p>Each lowering step makes a new set of hardware decisions visible to the compiler.</p>
                    </details>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </section>

