        <section class="section container" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
            <div class="section-heading section-heading-row">
                <div><p class="section-index">04 <span>/</span> Selected work</p><h2 id="work-title">Systems in <em>motion.</em></h2></div>
                <p class="section-aside">A few projects where software<br>meets the machine.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="project-grid">
                <article class="project-card project-featured">
                    <div class="project-topline"><span>01 / COMPILER</span><span>MLIR · RISC-V</span></div>
                    <h3>RICE Dialect<br>for Torch-MLIR</h3>
                    <p>A custom MLIR dialect for Transformer workloads on RISC-V, with high-level Attention and SwiGLU operations lowered through Linalg to vector intrinsics.</p>
                    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/BrainSeek-Lab/torch-mlir-rice" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                    <span class="project-glyph" aria-hidden="true">R<sub>x</sub></span>
                </article>
                <article class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-topline"><span>02 / ANALYSIS</span><span>C++ · LLVM</span></div>
                    <h3>LLVM compiler<br>passes</h3>
                    <p>Compiler analyses for range and pointer information, dependence-based loop parallelization, and automatic array bounds checking.</p>
                    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/anubhavkhajuria" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                </article>
                <article class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-topline"><span>03 / EFFICIENT ML</span><span>PyTorch · W4A8</span></div>
                    <h3>MobileNet compression</h3>
                    <p>Pruning and post-training quantization reduced MobileNet V2 model size 7.3×, from 11.4 MB to 1.56 MB, with under 4% accuracy loss.</p>
                    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/anubhavkhajuria" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                </article>
                <article class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-topline"><span>04 / TOOLING</span><span>LLVM · Clang</span></div>
                    <h3>Static analysis visualizer</h3>
                    <p>A visualization tool for LLVM/Clang Static Analyzer diagnostics and bug reports.</p>
                    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/nifey/static_analysis_viewer" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

